<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How the Mercer Lane Press website handles information and third-party services at launch."><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'Home',href:'/'},{name:'Privacy'}]}/><article class="page-head wrap prose"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p><strong>Last updated: September 19, 2026</strong></p><p>This page describes the starting privacy practices for mercerlanepress.com. It will be updated if the website’s features or data practices change.</p><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>This website currently has no user accounts, contact forms, comments, or newsletter sign-up. It therefore does not ask you to submit personal information through the site.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>At launch, the site does not set advertising or analytics cookies and does not include advertising trackers or analytics scripts. The hosting provider may process basic technical information—such as an IP address, request time, requested page, and browser details—to deliver and secure the site. Its practices are governed by its own terms and privacy materials.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>The site may link to other websites. Those sites control their own privacy practices. If purchase links are added, visiting a retailer will be subject to that retailer’s policies.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>If analytics, forms, embedded media, or other features are introduced, this page should be revised to explain them before or when they go live.</p></article></BaseLayout>
